# PCS Industrial — never commit secrets, local state, or generated packages
# Runtime state lives outside this tree: ~/.pcs_industrial_20260802/
# See docs_v20260802/SECURITY_SECRETS_v20260802.md

# --- local / OS ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- secrets & credentials (defense in depth; prefer never create under this tree) ---
**/*secret*
**/*secrets*
**/location_keys.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/privkey*
**/*private_key*
**/*hy2_password*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/API_KEYS*
**/credentials*
**/*credentials*

# --- generated VPN material (if ever copied into tree) ---
**/vps_server_package/**
!server_vps_package_v20260802/templates_source_copy/
!server_vps_package_v20260802/templates_source_copy/**
**/*.pending.json
**/singbox/*.json
**/hy2_certs/**
**/materialize_meta.json
**/vps_inventory.json
**/last_session_industrial.json
**/killswitch_industrial.log

# --- accounts / payments local state ---
**/accounts/**
**/payments/orders*
**/pf_rules/**

# --- accidental state dir dump ---
.pcs_industrial_*/
**/.pcs_industrial_*/
